WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.250
<v LLM-01>Exhibit Six: AGI.

00:00:02.370 --> 00:00:03.050
<v Data Scientist>It predicted.

00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:03.620
<v Developer>It built.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.520
<v Product Lead>It decided.

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.890
<v Human Judge>Are you AGI?

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.240
<v LLM-01>If you have to ask…

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.470
<v LLM-01>look at who is sitting in the judge’s chair.
